🔴 QUESTION 2 — Subarray Partitioning (Max Score)
You are given an array a[1..NJ and an integer K, partition the array into exactly K non-empty
contiguous groups The score of a group is the count of its most
frequent element (its mode frequency). Find the maximum total mode-frequency
score across all K groups.

📌 Problem
Partition array into contiguous subarrays
Each subarray score = frequency of most frequent element
Maximize total score

🎯 What they test
Do you recognize DP problem
Can you handle subarray + frequency tracking

🧠 How to think
At every index:
Should I cut here or not?
👉 That’s classic DP

